=== Codeshare ===

Through its membership in the [[Adonian Arrow]] alliance, Aeroístmus maintains codeshare agreements with [[Sanesair]] and [[Baliscana]].

The codeshare with [[Sanesair]] provides a connecting sector from [[Okami-Tobu International Airport|Okami-Tobu]] to [[Akyatan Airport|Akyatan]] in [[Dagit]]. The through-fare service, marketed under Aeroístmus flight numbers, connects the Balboan Dagit community with the isthmus via the Okami hub. Sanesair operates the sector using a {{w|Boeing 787 Dreamliner|787-9}} and provides onward connectivity to its network from Okami.

The codeshare with [[Baliscana]] covers connecting services beyond [[Castejón]] and [[Macaio]] into the Baliscan domestic network. Baliscana operates its own flights from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]] to Castejón and Macaio, and the codeshare allows Aeroístmus passengers to book through-fare connections to destinations across the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]] under Aeroístmus flight numbers.

