=== Sanrobonia expansion allocation ===

The Sanrobonian expansion is planned around 13 A321-family aircraft and one A330-family aircraft. Most Sanrobonian routes are to be operated by A321 aircraft. The Tanjung Seroja route is planned as a higher-yield business route with four daily frequencies, including three A321 rotations and one peak A330 rotation.

